{"title":"AoPS Wiki:What makes AoPS Wiki different","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table style=\"border:1px solid #999; background: #fff; margin: .3em .3em .3em 1em; padding: 3px; float:right\"><tbody><tr><td>\n<span id=\"shortcut\"><b>Shortcut</b>:<div style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=A:ABT\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"A:ABT\">A:ABT</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=A:DIFF\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"A:DIFF\">A:DIFF</a></div>\n</span></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>What makes <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Wiki\" title=\"AoPS Wiki\">AoPS Wiki</a> different from other wikis and web resources is that it serves a greater purpose for students than math dictionaries or math encyclopedias (which are usually written on the level of professional <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematician\" title=\"Mathematician\">mathematicians</a>).\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Contents\">Contents</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Wiki:What_makes_AoPS_Wiki_different&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Contents\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The AoPS Wiki includes the following:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Math\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Math\">Math</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Science\" title=\"Science\">science</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Computer_science\" title=\"Computer science\">computer science</a> concepts, facts, and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Theorem\" title=\"Theorem\">theorems</a> along with full explanations <i>at different levels</i> and sample problems with solutions.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Academic_competitions\" title=\"Academic competitions\">Academic competition</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Academic_scholarships\" title=\"Academic scholarships\">scholarship</a> information.</li>\n<li>Anything that <b>you</b> feel is broadly beneficial to young students of <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Problem_solving\" title=\"Problem solving\">problem solving</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Wiki:What_makes_AoPS_Wiki_different&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Wiki:Tutorial\" title=\"AoPS Wiki:Tutorial\">AoPS Wiki:Tutorial</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Wiki:What_AoPS_Wiki_is_not\" title=\"AoPS Wiki:What AoPS Wiki is not\">AoPS Wiki:What AoPS Wiki is not</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018012554\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.013 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.020 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 26/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 269/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 23/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.117      1 Template:Shortcut\n100.00%    7.117      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:30987:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018012554 and revision id 282698. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}